  "debsPinSource": "apt Packages SHA256 of noble, noble-updates, noble-security (main, universe, amd64); each Packages.xz checked against its InRelease; each InRelease verified by gpgv with ubuntu-archive-keyring.gpg taken from the pinned rootfs; the closure of apt install docker.io (Depends, Pre-Depends, Recommends) against the rootfs dpkg status; and python3.12 at 3.12.3-1ubuntu0.17, the five packages of that source the rootfs has at 3.12.3-1ubuntu0.16 (python3.12, python3.12-minimal, libpython3.12-minimal, libpython3.12-stdlib, libpython3.12t64; their Depends and Pre-Depends met by the rootfs), so that /usr/bin/python3.12 is the file the fleet pins (the source manifest hostTools). Installed offline by linux/first-host-prep.sh with dpkg -i from these files only (sha256sum -c first); git is the pinned rootfs own package."
